# Global agent instructions

Before doing any task, read `/Users/mmc/.cursor/AGENTS.md` in full and follow its instructions alongside applicable workspace and repository rules. Do this at the start of every new conversation, even when other rules are already supplied in context.

If the file cannot be read, tell the user before proceeding. Read it again after any edit to it.
